Win's VPN: licensing pointer

This repository holds components under different licenses. No single license
covers the whole tree.

- winn_protocol_experimental/ (Winn Protocol v3): GNU Affero General Public
  License v3.0 or later. Full text: winn_protocol_experimental/LICENSE.
  A commercial license is available separately; see legal/release/SOURCE_OFFER.txt.
- The Win's VPN applications and everything not covered above: the Win's VPN
  end-user license in legal/release/WINS_VPN_SOFTWARE_LICENSE.txt.
- Third-party components: legal/release/licenses/.

Publication of this tree for the Meta Global AI Developer Hackathon does not
grant rights beyond those licenses.
